# Private project hooks for {{ dist }}.
# Two shapes are accepted, matching what base_verbs.mk.j2 dispatches to:
#   * lifecycle hooks   (pre|post)-<verb>[-<what>]
#   * custom handlers   _custom_<verb>_<what> (new project-specific WHAT)
# Public targets, top-level variables, `define` macros, and `include`
# directives are rejected by `codegen conform`.
